<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Contact Us | Nigeria Pry & Sec Result Vault</title>
    <style>
        body { background: #f8fafc; margin: 0; font-family: sans-serif; color: #1e293b; }
        .navbar { background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 1rem 2rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
        .logo { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 900; color: #1e3a8a; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .container { max-width: 980px; margin: 2.5rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .card { background: #fff; padding: 1.75rem; border-radius: 1rem; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
        .btn-wa { display: inline-block; background: #16a34a; color: #fff; padding: 0.7rem 1.15rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0.65rem; margin-right: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .btn-blue { display: inline-block; background: #1e3a8a; color: #fff; padding: 0.7rem 1.15rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0.65rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        input, textarea, select { width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem; margin: 0.4rem 0 1rem 0; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 0.5rem; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; }
        .btn-submit { background: #1e3a8a; color: #fff; border: none; padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; width: 100%; font-size: 1rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar">
        <a href="/" class="logo">Nigeria Pry & Sec Result Vault</a>
        <div>
            <a href="/" style="margin-right:1rem;color:#1e3a8a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;">Home</a>
            <a href="/login" style="color:#1e3a8a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;">Log In</a>
        </div>
    </nav>
    <div class="container">
        <h1 style="color:#1e3a8a;margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Contact Support & Official Office</h1>
        <p style="color:#64748b;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:2rem;">Need help unlocking a term vault, verifying a payment, or registering your school anywhere in Nigeria? Reach our support desk directly.</p>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#1e3a8a;">💬 Phone & WhatsApp Support</h3>
                <p style="margin:0.3rem 0;"><strong>Phone / WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="tel:+2348105752678" style="color:#1e3a8a;text-decoration:none;">+234 810 575 2678</a></p>
                <p style="margin:0.3rem 0;color:#64748b;font-size:0.9rem;">Mon – Sat, 8:00 AM – 6:00 PM (WAT)</p>
                <a href="https://wa.me" target="_blank" class="btn-wa">Chat Support on WhatsApp</a>
                <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/Leg0vgDSgp22OIMHlh5E51?s=cl&p=i&iam=2" target="_blank" class="btn-blue">Join Official WhatsApp Group</a>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#1e3a8a;">🏢 Head Office & Official Email</h3>
                <p style="margin:0.3rem 0;"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@nigeriapryandsecresultvaultcom.com" style="color:#1e3a8a;word-break:break-all;">info@nigeriapryandsecresultvaultcom.com</a></p>
                <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;"><strong>Head Office Address:</strong><br>Plot 1229, Ladoke Akintola Boulevard, Garki II, Abuja, Nigeria</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#1e3a8a;">Send Us a Direct Inquiry</h3>
            <% if (typeof sent !== 'undefined' && sent) { %>
                <div style="background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46;padding:1rem;border-radius:0.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;font-weight:bold;">✓ Message received! Our team will follow up with you shortly.</div>
            <% } %>
            <form action="/contact" method="POST">
                <label>Full Name</label>
                <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="e.g. Mr. Oghenekevwe Ojo" required>
                <label>Phone / WhatsApp Number</label>
                <input type="text" name="phone" placeholder="e.g. 0810 575 2678" required>
                <label>Inquiry Type</label>
                <select name="topic">
                    <option>Parent / Student Vault Support</option>
                    <option>School Partnership & Registry Onboarding</option>
                    <option>₦200,000 – ₦5,000,000 Grant Inquiry</option>
                </select>
                <label>Message</label>
                <textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="How can we assist you?" required></textarea>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Send Message</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
